 & Zero Unwritten Action Hallucinations)**\n- **Only explicit CLI commands** from the SOP are included:\n  - `Test-Connection`\n  - `reg query`\n  - `reg delete`\n  - `gpupdate /force`\n- **No unwritten actions** (e.g., `send_email`, `search_users`) are added.\n- **Fallback commands** are set to `null` unless explicitly stated in the SOP.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 5 (Verification & Output Parsing Instructions)**\n- **Output parsing instructions** added for each step:\n  - **Step 1 (Connectivity)**: Check for `Reply from` in output.\n  - **Step 2 (Identify Block)**: Check for `Debugger` or `ERROR` in output.\n  - **Step 3 (Remove Block)**: Check for `The operation completed successfully`.\n  - **Step 4 (Refresh Policy)**: Check for `Computer Policy update has completed successfully`.\n  - **Step 5 (Verify Removal)**: Check for `ERROR` or absence of `Debugger`.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 6 (100% Diagnostic Step Recall Mandate)**\n- **All 7 steps** from the SOP are preserved:\n  1. Verify Endpoint Connectivity\n  2. Identify Application Blocking Mechanism\n  3. Remove IFEO Block (Fallback)\n  4. Refresh Local Policy\n  5. Verify Block Removal\n  6. Validate Resolution (Omitted as per mandate)\n  7. Update Ticket (Omitted as per mandate)\n\n- **Steps 6 and 7** are omitted due to **manual/human confirmation** requirements.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 7 (Conditional Branch Mapping & `execute_if`)**\n- **Conditional logic** mapped:\n  - **Step 3 (Remove IFEO Block)**: Executes **only if** `variables.ifeo_block_found == 'true'`.\n  - **Step 5 (Verify Removal)**: Executes **only if** `variables.ifeo_block_removed == 'true'`.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 8 (Dynamic Timeout Allocation by Action Scope)**\n- **Timeouts assigned**:\n  - **Quick Info Read** (`Test-Connection`, `reg query`): **30s**\n  - **System Scan** (`reg delete`): **90s**\n  - **Policy Refresh** (`gpupdate /force`): **120s**\n\n---\n\n### **Final OKF Playbook JSON Schema**\n```json\n{\n    \"reasoning_chain\": [\n        \"[Stage 1 Verification Gates]: Gate 1 (Function match) -> Gate 2 (Provider active) -> Gate 3 (Problem aligned) -> Gate 4 (Params complete) -> Result: command\",\n        \"[Stage 2 Sequencing]: Ordered search/diagnostic steps before remediation\",\n        \"[Stage 3 Variables]: Formatted {{entities.var}} placeholders for computer_name and application_exe\",\n        \"[Stage 4 Fallbacks]: Mapped fallback actions as null (no unwritten steps added)\",\n        \"[Stage 5 Verification]: Added output parse instructions for CLI stdout inspection\",\n        \"[Stage 6 Recall]: Preserved 100% of diagnostic steps (omitted manual/human steps as per mandate)\",\n        \"[Stage 7 Branching]: Mapped execute_if conditions for conditional steps\",\n        \"[Stage 8 Timeouts]: Assigned timeout_seconds (30s for quick reads, 90s for scans, 120s for policy refresh)\"\n    ],\n    \"sop_id\": \"SOP-L1-APP-001\",\n    \"title\": \"Software Application Unblock Request (IFEO Debugger Entry Removal)\",\n    \"category\": \"software\",\n    \"target_os\": \"windows\",\n    \"description\": \"This playbook automates the identification and removal of an Image File Execution Options (IFEO) debugger entry blocking a software application on a Windows endpoint. It includes connectivity checks, registry queries, block removal, policy refresh, and verification.\",\n    \"required_entities\": [\"computer_name\", \"application_exe\"],\n    \"trigger_words\": [\"unblock\", \"application\", \"IFEO\", \"debugger\", \"registry\"],\n    \"steps\": [\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 1,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Verify endpoint connectivity using Test-Connection.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"command\",\n            \"platform\": null,\n            \"provider\": null,\n            \"function_name\": null,\n            \"comm_inputs\": null,\n            \"command\": \"Test-Connection {{entities.computer_name}} -Count 2\",\n            \"shell\": \"powershell\",\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"Reply from\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 30,\n            \"output_variable\": \"connectivity_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"If output contains 'Reply from', set 'connectivity_confirmed' to 'true'. Otherwise, set 'connectivity_confirmed' to 'false'.\",\n            \"execute_if\": null,\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 2,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Identify if the application is blocked by an IFEO Debugger entry.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"command\",\n            \"platform\": null,\n            \"provider\": null,\n            \"function_name\": null,\n            \"comm_inputs\": null,\n            \"command\": \"reg query \\\"HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows NT\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Image File Execution Options\\\\{{entities.application_exe}}\\\"\",\n            \"shell\": \"powershell\",\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"Debugger|ERROR\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 30,\n            \"output_variable\": \"ifeo_check_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"If output contains 'Debugger', set 'ifeo_block_found' to 'true'. If output contains 'ERROR', set 'ifeo_block_found' to 'false'.\",\n            \"execute_if\": \"variables.connectivity_confirmed == 'true'\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 3,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Remove the IFEO Debugger entry if it exists.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"command\",\n            \"platform\": null,\n            \"provider\": null,\n            \"function_name\": null,\n            \"comm_inputs\": null,\n            \"command\": \"reg delete \\