idelity & Zero Unwritten Action Hallucinations)**\n- **Only explicit CLI commands** from the SOP are included:\n  - `Test-Connection`\n  - `reg query`\n  - `reg delete`\n  - `gpupdate /force`\n- **No unwritten actions** (e.g., `send_email`, `search_users`) are added.\n- **Fallback commands** are set to `null` unless explicitly stated in the SOP.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 5 (Verification & Output Parsing Instructions)**\n- **Output parsing instructions** added for each step:\n  - **Step 1 (Connectivity)**: Check for `Reply from` in output.\n  - **Step 2 (Identify Block)**: Check for `Debugger` or `ERROR` in output.\n  - **Step 3 (Remove Block)**: Check for `The operation completed successfully`.\n  - **Step 4 (Refresh Policy)**: Check for `Computer Policy update has completed successfully`.\n  - **Step 5 (Verify Removal)**: Check for `ERROR` or absence of `Debugger`.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 6 (100% Diagnostic Step Recall Mandate)**\n- **All 7 steps** from the SOP are preserved:\n  1. Verify Endpoint Connectivity\n  2. Identify Application Blocking Mechanism\n  3. Remove IFEO Block (Fallback)\n  4. Refresh Local Policy\n  5. Verify Block Removal\n  6. Validate Resolution (Omitted as per mandate)\n  7. Update Ticket (Omitted as per mandate)\n\n- **Steps 6 and 7** are omitted due to **manual/human confirmation** requirements.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 7 (Conditional Branch Mapping & `execute_if`)**\n- **Conditional logic** mapped:\n  - **Step 3 (Remove IFEO Block)**: Executes **only if** `variables.ifeo_block_found == 'true'`.\n  - **Step 5 (Verify Removal)**: Executes **only if** `variables.ifeo_block_removed == 'true'`.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 8 (Dynamic Timeout Allocation by Action Scope)**\n- **Timeouts assigned**:\n  - **Quick Info Read** (`Test-Connection`, `reg query`): **30s**\n  - **System Scan** (`reg delete`): **90s**\n  - **Policy Refresh** (`gpupdate /force`): **120s**\n\n---\n\n### **Final OKF Playbook JSON Schema**\n```json\n{\n    \"reasoning_chain\": [\n       