ned to L1 Engineer.\n\n(cid:127) Remote administrative access to the endpoint.\n\n(cid:127) User device is online.\n\nAdministrative privileges available.\n\n3.  Process Flow Overview\n\nThe diagram below summarizes the end-to-end decision flow. Full instructions for each stage are provided in\nSection 4, Detailed Procedure.\n\n1. Verify\nConnectivity\n\n2. Identify Blocking\nMechanism\n\n3–5. Remove, Refresh\n& Verify\n\nIs the application blocked via an IFEO Debugger entry? (Step 2)\n\nYES — IFEO Debugger Entry Found\n\nNO — Registry Key Not Found\n\nProceed to Step 3 — remove the Debugger entry\n(and the key itself if it exists solely to block the app),\nthen refresh policy and verify.\n\nApplication is not blocked through IFEO. Investigate\nAppLocker, WDAC, Intune, or Endpoint Security\npolicies, or escalate to L2.\n\nIT Service Desk — Confidential / Internal Use Only\n\nPage 3\n\n(cid:127)\n(cid:127)\nﬁ\nﬁ\n\fSOP-L1-APP-001\n\nSoftware Application Unblock Request\n\n4.  Detailed Procedure\n\nSTEP 1  —  Verify Endpoint Connectivity\n\nCommand\n\nTest-Connection <ComputerName> -Count 2\n\n4 Expected Result: Reply received from target system.\n\nIf unreachable — Action:\n\nVerify VPN / network connectivity.\n\n(cid:127) Retry.\n\nEscalate if unreachable.\n\nSTEP 2  —  Identify Application Blocking Mechanism\n\nCommand\n\nreg query \"HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Image File Execution Options\\<Application>.exe\"\n\nExpected\n\n## CONVERTED OKF STEPS JSON:\n[\n  {\n    \"step_number\": 1,\n    \"sop_step_description\": \"Verify endpoint connectivity using Test-Connection.\",\n    \"step_type\": \"command\",\n    \"platform\": null,\n    \"provider\": null,\n    \"function_name\": null,\n    \"comm_inputs\": null,\n    \"command\": \"Test-Connection {{entities.computer_name}} -Count 2\",\n    \"fallback_command\": null,\n    \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n    \"parse_instruction\": null,\n    \"execute_if\": null,\n    \"timeout_seconds\": 30\n  },\n  {\n    \"step_number\": 2,\n    \"sop_step_description\": \"Identify if the application is blocked by an IFEO Debugger entry.\",\n    \"step_type\": \"command\",\n    \"platform\": null,\n    \"provider\": null,\n    \"function_name\": null,\n    \"comm_inputs\": null,\n    \"command\": \"reg query \\\"HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows NT\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Image File Execution Options\\\\{{entities.application_exe}}\\\"\",\n    \"fallback_command\": null,\n    \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n    \"parse_instruction\": null,\n    \"execute_if\": \"variables.connectivity_confirmed == 'true'\",\n    \"timeout_seconds\": 30\n  },\n  {\n    \"step_number\": 3,\n    \"sop_step_description\": \"Remove the IFEO Debugger entry if it exists.\",\n    \"step_type\": \"command\",\n    \"platform\": null,\n    \"provider\": null,\n    \"function_name\": null,\n    \"comm_inputs\": null,\n    \"command\": \"reg delete \\\"HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows NT\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Image File Execution Options\\\\{{entities.application_exe}}\\\" /v Debugger /f\",\n    \"fallback_command\": \"reg delete \\\"HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows NT\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Image File Execution Options\\\\{{entities.application_exe}}\\\" /f\",\n    \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n    \"parse_instruction\": null,\n    \"execute_if\": \"variables.ifeo_block_found == 'true'\",\n    \"timeout_seconds\": 90\n  },\n  {\n    \"step_number\": 4,\n    \"sop_step_description\": \"Refresh local Group Policy to apply changes.\",\n    \"step_type\": \"command\",\n    \"platform\": null,\n    \"provider\": null,\n    \"function_name\": null,\n    \"comm_inputs\": null,\n    \"command\": \"gpupdate /force\",\n    \"fallback_command\": null,\n    \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n    \"parse_instruction\": null,\n    \"execute_if\": \"variables.ifeo_block_removed == 'true'\",\n    \"timeout_seconds\": 120\n  },\n  {\n    \"step_number\": 5,\n    \"sop_step_description\": \"Verify that the IFEO